bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Notification Page" as UI
boundary Router
control NotificationController
control NotificationService
entity NotificationModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click "Mark all as read"
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /api/notification/mark-all-noti-as-read
activate Router

Router -> NotificationController: 3. markAllNotiAsRead()
activate NotificationController

NotificationController -> NotificationService: 4. markAllAsRead(payload)
activate NotificationService

opt Invalid user
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: 4.1. BadRequestException
  NotificationController --> Router: 4.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 4.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 4.4. Show error
end

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 5. updateMany(receiver_id, is_read=false)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 6. update notifications (set is_read=true)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 7. update result
deactivate MongoDB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: 8. return update result
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService --> NotificationController: 9. success result
deactivate NotificationService

NotificationController --> Router: 10. HTTP response
deactivate NotificationController

Router --> UI: 11. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. All notifications marked as read
deactivate UI
deactivate User